Third-party data
----------------

The reference run downloads the following dataset at run time. It is verified
against a pinned SHA-256, cached locally, and never committed.

  Sentiment Labelled Sentences
  UCI Machine Learning Repository, dataset 331
  https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/331/sentiment+labelled+sentences

  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  Required attribution:
    Kotzias, D. (2015). Sentiment Labelled Sentences [Dataset].
    UCI Machine Learning Repository. https://doi.org/10.24432/C57604

  Original research:
    Kotzias, D., Denil, M., de Freitas, N., Smyth, P. (2015).
    "From Group to Individual Labels using Deep Features."
    KDD 2015.

CC BY 4.0 requires attribution from anyone who uses or adapts the dataset.
That obligation extends to anything derived from it, including models trained
on it and results reported from it. Every model bundle this pipeline produces
records the dataset licence and citation in its lineage for that reason.

See docs/DATA.md for the full provenance record and the refresh procedure.
